  {
    "id": "libreoffice-am-help01.po:43975",
    "file": "libreoffice-am-help01.po",
    "line_start": 43975,
    "line_end": 43982,
    "fuzzy": false,
    "translated": true,
    "msgctxt": "06150110.xhp\npar_id3149549\nhelp.text",
    "msgid": "<ahelp hid=\"filter/ui/xmlfiltertabpagegeneral/interfacename\">Enter the name that you want to display in the <emph>File type</emph> box in file dialogs.</ahelp> You must enter a unique name. For import filters, the name appears in the <emph>File type</emph> box of <emph>Open</emph> dialogs. For export filters, the name appears in the <emph>File format</emph> box of <emph>Export</emph> dialogs.",
    "msgstr": "<ahelp hid=\"filter/ui/xmlfiltertabpagegeneral/interfacename\">እርስዎ ማሳየት የሚፈልጉትን ስም ያስገቡ በ <emph> ፋይል አይነት </emph> ሳጥን በ ፋይል ንግግሮች ውስጥ: </ahelp> እርስዎ የ ተለየ ስም ማስገባት አለብዎት ለ ማጣሪያዎች ማምጫ: ስሙ ይታያል በ <emph> ፋይል አይነት </emph> ሳጥን በ <emph> መክፈቻ </emph> ንግግሮች ውስጥ: ማጣሪያዎች ለመላክ: ስሙ ይታያል በ <emph> ፋይል አቀራረብ </emph> ሳጥን ውስጥ በ <emph> መላኪያ </emph> ንግግሮች ውስጥ",
    "raw_block": "#. DZDFi\n#: 06150110.xhp\nmsgctxt \"\"\n\"06150110.xhp\\n\"\n\"par_id3149549\\n\"\n\"help.text\"\nmsgid \"<ahelp hid=\\\"filter/ui/xmlfiltertabpagegeneral/interfacename\\\">Enter the name that you want to display in the <emph>File type</emph> box in file dialogs.</ahelp> You must enter a unique name. For import filters, the name appears in the <emph>File type</emph> box of <emph>Open</emph> dialogs. For export filters, the name appears in the <emph>File format</emph> box of <emph>Export</emph> dialogs.\"\nmsgstr \"<ahelp hid=\\\"filter/ui/xmlfiltertabpagegeneral/interfacename\\\">እርስዎ ማሳየት የሚፈልጉትን ስም ያስገቡ በ <emph> ፋይል አይነት </emph> ሳጥን በ ፋይል ንግግሮች ውስጥ: </ahelp> እርስዎ የ ተለየ ስም ማስገባት አለብዎት ለ ማጣሪያዎች ማምጫ: ስሙ ይታያል በ <emph> ፋይል አይነት </emph> ሳጥን በ <emph> መክፈቻ </emph> ንግግሮች ውስጥ: ማጣሪያዎች ለመላክ: ስሙ ይታያል በ <emph> ፋይል አቀራረብ </emph> ሳጥን ውስጥ በ <emph> መላኪያ </emph> ንግግሮች ውስጥ\""
  },
